  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-12T22:37:24.029906Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-15T04:40:39.735907Z",
  "totalBlocks": 114,
  "translatedBlocks": 113,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2477dd18c57d13a",
      "translationZh": "3 个月前，我们开始重振 Papers with Code（另见公告推文）。它的目标是让开放的 AI 研究易于获取和理解，让人们能够轻松找到与论文相关的研究产物，了解 AI 各个领域的最先进水平（SOTA），分享有趣的研究，并在彼此工作的基础上继续构建。换句话说，它的目标是为催生下一个 Transformer 的研究浪潮提供动力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8836be58b7cf2478",
      "translationZh": "当然，要让 AI 研究易于获取，就需要一个强大的搜索引擎，让人类和智能体能够通过网站或 pwc search CLI 命令快速找到相关及关联工作；智能体可以通过 Skill 使用该命令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af39be44630c7347",
      "translationZh": "需要注意的是，搜索研究成果与搜索普通文本并不完全相同。一个实用的论文搜索引擎应该能找到精确的标题或 arXiv 标识符，但也应该能理解“小型语言模型用于代码生成”这样的查询，即使这些词并未在某篇论文中同时出现。它需要识别出“最初的 BERT 论文”是一个导航型请求，容忍不完整的标题或拼写错误，并且在模型服务处于冷启动状态或暂时不可用时，仍能快速响应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23167739c17dc704",
      "translationZh": "Papers with Code 上针对 DINO 查询的搜索结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0418643b44f5591d",
      "translationZh": "我们为 Papers with Code 构建了一个混合搜索系统。这也基于我们此前在 ML6 的经验，当时我们为客户开发了基于 RAG 的系统。实践表明，混合搜索通常优于基于关键词或向量的搜索系统，因为它结合了两者的优势（更多信息另见这篇博客）。关键词搜索查找精确出现的内容，而向量搜索则查找更模糊、语义相似的词语。请注意，重排序器（也称为交叉编码器）可以进一步改善结果，不过也会带来额外的开销和延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a6c459a12246ab6",
      "translationZh": "混合检索优于仅使用关键词或向量的搜索。图片来自 Microsoft，Azure AI Search：《通过混合检索和重排序超越向量搜索》（2023）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c1b205c44743744",
      "translationZh": "Papers with Code 依赖 PostgreSQL 数据库，因此其全文搜索能力提供了一个快速的词法检索基线。对于稠密嵌入，我们使用 pgvector 来增加语义召回，并通过倒数排名融合（RRF）算法结合这两者。稠密嵌入使用了三项 Hugging Face 服务：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3225f15fea4c2504",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Jobs 为我们提供可突发扩容的 GPU 算力，用于为论文语料库生成嵌入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7e69570d89d51b8",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Storage Buckets 在我们的数据库、实验和 Jobs 之间提供持久化的数据交接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c8ae1164332b3fa",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 为实时查询和增量更新提供低延迟的嵌入向量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa774c2600622c85",
      "translationZh": "目前，该系统维护着来自 arXiv 和 Daily Papers 的超过 110,000 篇当前论文的嵌入向量。本文介绍了系统架构、背后的设计决策，以及我们在将其投入生产环境的过程中获得的经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "64459b6056cea83e",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c6809e2c5f56019",
      "translationZh": "我们有意将搜索拆分为离线语料库构建和在线搜索服务：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3918029f28325c4",
      "translationZh": "离线语料库构建与在线混合搜索流水线的架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "120bea6ee2b0eac8",
      "translationZh": "计算成本高、以吞吐量为导向的工作作为 Jobs 运行。持久化产物存放在一个 Bucket 中。只有轻量的查询嵌入向量生成步骤位于请求路径上，通过一个受保护的 Inference Endpoint 为在线搜索提供支持。如果该端点处于冷启动状态、繁忙或不健康，搜索会立即回退到全文检索。这种分离让系统既强大又快速。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a4806305e1c2e4ec",
      "translationZh": "从严格的嵌入契约开始",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8ab274292602d1a",
      "translationZh": "嵌入流水线往往会以不易察觉的方式出错：模型修订版本发生变化，查询提示词和文档提示词被混用，向量的截断方式不一致，或者更新后的摘要不再与其存储的向量匹配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36d658cd44e42d98",
      "translationZh": "我们通过将嵌入格式视为一个带版本管理的 API 来避免这些问题。每篇论文都按以下格式编码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e5eec0c01b76656",
      "translationZh": "每次生成向量时，我们都会记录：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0db54044fc978ce6",
      "translationZh": "模型仓库及确切的修订版本；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37257b7ac254e0e6",
      "translationZh": "输出维度；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "67e39e787def8e49",
      "translationZh": "输入格式版本；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f953c297c33c2f85",
      "translationZh": "输入是查询还是文档；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "09883349d0cd1edb",
      "translationZh": "归一化方法；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b0c0221c8bffddd7",
      "translationZh": "源标题和摘要的内容哈希。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb250f2e699cbc93",
      "translationZh": "我们在生产环境中使用 Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B 生成嵌入，锁定到一个确切的修订版本，并采用经过 L2 归一化的 256 维向量。我们借助 MTEB 排行榜选择了该模型，这个排行榜是比较嵌入模型时的首选基准。请注意，Qwen3 等较新的嵌入模型支持 2 项新功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e092b4d30a0afc7",
      "translationZh": "可以指定动态嵌入维度，从而在质量与速度及存储成本之间进行权衡。Qwen 模型将其称为“MRL”，即 Matryoshka Representation Learning（套娃式表示学习）的缩写。你可以在这里全面了解它。我们选择了 256 的嵌入维度，以加快搜索速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ac4d77f9407fdd0",
      "translationZh": "可以提供指令提示词。Qwen 嵌入模型支持文档提示词（我们用它为论文生成嵌入），而实时搜索则使用其查询提示词（为用户查询生成嵌入）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02a37e3362ed87a1",
      "translationZh": "这一约定贯穿嵌入从导出、经由 GPU 推理、进入 PostgreSQL，最终用于在线检索的整个流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3c7611aaaff8f24a",
      "translationZh": "Jobs 将数据库快照转化为向量语料库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0baf028685690326",
      "translationZh": "为整个语料库生成嵌入是一种典型的批处理工作负载。它只在相对较短的时间内需要 GPU，能够受益于高吞吐量，而且在两次运行之间不应消耗资源。Hugging Face Jobs 很适合这种工作模式：一个 Job 由一条命令、一种硬件规格以及可选的 Docker 镜像定义，并且可以运行以行内方式声明依赖项的 uv 脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc86392ec8fef5ca",
      "translationZh": "我们的语料库构建流程首先从采用可重复读隔离级别的 PostgreSQL 快照中导出每篇论文的最新版本。导出器以流式方式处理数据行，而不是将整个目录加载到内存中；它写出大小受限的 JSONL 分片，并创建一个包含行数和 SHA-256 校验和的清单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8197c9c3c63d428",
      "translationZh": "我们将该不可变的运行目录同步到一个私有 Storage Bucket，并将这个 Bucket 直接挂载（使用 hf-mount）到一个 l4x1 Job 中（配备一块 NVIDIA L4 GPU，拥有 24GB 显存）。从工作进程的角度看，它就是一个文件系统：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "511e0755e30beb14",
      "translationZh": "工作进程会：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ecdf57850f4c5d11",
      "translationZh": "验证输入清单以及每个分片的校验和；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3736ad7866fdbe51",
      "translationZh": "加载固定版本的模型；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "171320670ec7884e",
      "translationZh": "按长度对文本排序，以减少填充；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2cc4501dbe39faf2",
      "translationZh": "批量调用 encode_document（如模型卡中所述）；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f9b41b2d7de323c",
      "translationZh": "在 GPU 显存不足时自动减小批次大小；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27c8f64a49cbf09b",
      "translationZh": "将 Matryoshka 表示截断至 256 维，并对其进行归一化；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e6fd48ed9ad0900",
      "translationZh": "以原子方式写入 float16 Parquet 分片；并且",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3cfab16fea8834ec",
      "translationZh": "记录吞吐量、软件包版本、硬件、峰值显存、行数和输出校验和。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8260e722a9e5e27",
      "translationZh": "每个已完成的分片都有自己的标记，因此重新启动的 Job 可以跳过已验证的工作。这对大型语料库很有用：重试应该只是继续工作，而不是覆盖现有的嵌入向量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10a799ea76eb51c0",
      "translationZh": "在我们涉及 5,000 篇论文的试点中，Qwen Job 在一块 L4 GPU 上以 1024 维编码，每秒处理约 75 篇论文。同一次处理的结果可以确定性地以 512 维和 256 维形式生成，因此我们可以比较存储与检索方面的权衡，而无需为更多推理付费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f6e091ab84134511",
      "translationZh": "Buckets 是连接各部分的纽带",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96df28195e74c31b",
      "translationZh": "Storage Buckets 是 Hub 上可修改的、类似 S3 的对象存储，专为 AI 工作负载优化。它们可以通过 hf://buckets/... 路径访问，并以读写方式挂载到 Jobs 中，无需另行构建存储集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dee687ecf248d739",
      "translationZh": "对我们而言，Bucket 不只是存放向量的地方。它是三个具有不同生命周期的系统之间的边界：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46c9a2bd35ed055e",
      "translationZh": "生产数据库导出源记录；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b36df58292f767a2",
      "translationZh": "临时 Jobs 消费这些记录并生成向量；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8dc7591d205e1377",
      "translationZh": "导入器在对搜索索引进行任何操作之前，会先验证结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bab39d683531bb6",
      "translationZh": "我们将产物组织在不可变的运行前缀下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46c26c62b239ced9",
      "translationZh": "存储桶本身被刻意设计为可变，因此不可变性是一条应用层规则：运行 ID 永远不会被覆盖，而且每个产物都有清单和校验和。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61ea66921a4c41db",
      "translationZh": "这为我们带来了几个有用的特性：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc380a8bddefb46b",
      "translationZh": "可复现性：我们可以将某一代数据库追溯到确切的语料库快照、模型修订版本和产物集合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff2554b423f8171c",
      "translationZh": "安全重试：Jobs 可以在同一运行前缀下，基于已完成的分片继续执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25f8a73505572bec",
      "translationZh": "低成本实验：多个模型或不同维度可以复用同一个已验证的输入快照。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0885690867356939",
      "translationZh": "受控上线：导入一个代次并不会激活它。我们首先验证覆盖情况，并构建该代次的索引。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb8caed10714e79c",
      "translationZh": "简单回滚：在新代次被证实稳定之前，上一代次及其产物会一直保持可用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70d86fb0bc1feccf",
      "translationZh": "只有在导入器重新检查模式、校验和、维度、归一化、论文 ID 的唯一性以及当前内容哈希之后，我们才会将向量加载到 PostgreSQL 中。随后，我们为新代次构建独立的 HNSW 索引，并且只有在覆盖所有符合条件的当前论文后，才会以原子方式将其标记为活跃（HNSW 是一种支持快速向量搜索的基于图的算法）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ad08df5ccf348041",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 将语义搜索引入请求处理路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21d1ed38435ead9b",
      "translationZh": "批量嵌入解决了检索中文档侧的问题。用户查询仍然需要在请求时使用相同的模型契约生成嵌入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b25c3ba6db3c857c",
      "translationZh": "我们将固定版本的模型部署为一个需要身份认证的 Inference Endpoint，其后端由 Text Embeddings Inference (TEI) 提供支持。该端点接收查询文本，并使用模型的查询提示词返回一个归一化的 256 维向量。请注意，这里也可以使用 vLLM 或 SGLang。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5f8a2f47b6d5751",
      "translationZh": "用于 Papers with Code 查询嵌入模型的 Hugging Face Inference Endpoint。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbba428ffefa8e2c",
      "translationZh": "随后，API 在活跃的 pgvector 代次上执行余弦距离搜索：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "551dada719ce27d9",
      "translationZh": "HNSW 索引使这项查找保持快速。在我们针对 5,000 篇论文开展的试点测试中，256 维 Qwen 索引相对于精确搜索的 Recall@20 达到了 0.9955，HNSW 查找延迟的 p50 为 1.31 ms，p95 为 2.21 ms。其表和索引的存储占用约为 1024 维版本的 27%，同时在该测试中保留了基本相同的 ANN 召回率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a98794fd040b3554",
      "translationZh": "该 Endpoint 配置为最多一个副本，并且可以在空闲时缩容至零。这是一种实用的成本调节手段，因为这意味着没有使用时就无需付费。不过，这也意味着冷启动必须纳入应用设计，而不能被视为异常事件，因为端点需要一些时间才能启动并处理流量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc71192db5861951",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们的查询客户端有意采用了严格的行为约束：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e37a9d587c6550c5",
      "translationZh": "生产环境中一秒的超时限制；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f44a1b905a21d0c6",
      "translationZh": "非阻塞的并发限制；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c291ab3d959500e8",
      "translationZh": "对响应的维度、数值有限性和范数进行校验；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3cda9c6e2b7d3c8d",
      "translationZh": "以查询和嵌入生成版本为键的短期缓存；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39d2996d486ba005",
      "translationZh": "在反复失败后触发熔断器；以及",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87b7256910eb05c7",
      "translationZh": "日志中不记录原始查询文本，只记录规范化后的指纹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83f89615bdb1a39a",
      "translationZh": "如果端点正在扩容、请求超时、返回格式错误的向量，或没有可用的并发容量，我们就会立即跳过语义分支。用户仍然会收到词法检索结果，而不必等待不可靠的依赖服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b97b46df10260af",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 运行非常可靠，还提供了一个很不错的仪表板，让你可以快速查看关键分析指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0988865f942eea6",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoint 分析视图，展示请求量、错误、延迟和副本状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f587e2fbe8f0a1f6",
      "translationZh": "混合检索比单独使用任一分支都更强",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "137743991e2989fe",
      "translationZh": "对于每个查询，词法分支使用加权的 PostgreSQL 全文搜索，检索最多 50 个候选项。语义分支则从 pgvector 中检索最多 50 个候选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "225e53298854740c",
      "translationZh": "我们使用加权倒数排名融合（RRF）来合并它们的排名：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a79bb9a8a4c7fb81",
      "translationZh": "RRF 简单且稳健，因为它融合的是两个系统的排名，而不是各自采用不同尺度的分数。基本上，如果一篇论文在词法分支和语义分支中的排名都很高，那么它在混合搜索中获得高排名的可能性就更大。我们目前对各分支使用相等的权重，并采用 (k=60)（k 是“排名常数”，属于 RRF 算法的一个超参数）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7cfdc48b9073967",
      "translationZh": "稠密检索能够提高概念性查询的召回率。全文检索在精确术语、标识符和罕见名称的检索方面仍然表现出色。我们还在融合排名的基础上保留了确定性的身份匹配行为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5014376824fc9fe",
      "translationZh": "精确匹配的标题和 arXiv ID 始终排在最前面；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f2a5a77415e36d6b",
      "translationZh": "方法分类体系能够识别导航式搜索，例如“最初的 BERT 论文”；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48bad927c5f242eb",
      "translationZh": "对于不完整的标题和一定范围内的拼写错误，采用保守的三元字符组候选项；并且",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "273308a4baaffd5e",
      "translationZh": "对于存在歧义的模糊匹配，选择不返回匹配，而不是强行给出糟糕的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8495114110f046dd",
      "translationZh": "注意：混合搜索并不总是最佳选择，建议先将关键词搜索作为成本低、速度快的基线，只有在语义搜索和/或混合搜索确实能合理提升检索质量时，才加入它们。还可以在关键词/语义/混合检索之后添加重排序器，使用 Qwen3-Reranker 这样的模型，进一步改进搜索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2231ad3040bab485",
      "translationZh": "一个端点，两条更新路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee6b6583b7bb9797",
      "translationZh": "大规模初始语料库通过 Jobs 进行嵌入处理，但 Papers with Code 一直在变化。新论文不断加入，摘要会被修正，新的 arXiv 版本也会成为最新版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0f73737d8d750a8",
      "translationZh": "仅为少量发生变化的行启动一个 GPU Job，会带来不必要的启动和编排开销。因此，一个每小时运行的增量处理流程会筛选出缺少嵌入或内容发生变化的论文，并将规模受限的增量数据发送到同一个 TEI Endpoint，这次使用的是文档提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2ffe24ef252c37a",
      "translationZh": "每次运行最多处理 500 篇论文，每批 16 篇。在写入嵌入之前，会锁定源数据行，并再次检查其内容哈希。如果某篇论文在推理期间发生了变化，就会丢弃对应的向量，并在下一次运行时重新处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "190e7274a81a645e",
      "translationZh": "这样就形成了一种实用的分工：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b88eb663e295999",
      "translationZh": "Jobs 负责完整重建、新一代模型的处理以及大规模回填。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "911a309433f79a5b",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 负责交互式查询嵌入和小规模增量文档更新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01a506e9da55eecf",
      "translationZh": "Buckets 保存大规模构建的产物，使这些构建能够恢复执行并接受审计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c309fc63a86d7023",
      "translationZh": "每小时运行的处理路径让当前使用的索引与实时目录保持接近，同时避免将在线端点变成一个没有规模限制的批处理器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8c158a243cb4826e",
      "translationZh": "在线推荐相关论文的成本几乎为零",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87d0507a647eb8d1",
      "translationZh": "同一套文档嵌入也为每个论文页面上的相关论文推荐提供支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5babe8c39677050",
      "translationZh": "与 SenseNova-U1 相关的论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bcaf2ac29d3a433",
      "translationZh": "由于源论文已有存储的向量，检索相关论文时无需在请求期间调用模型。只需对当前启用的一代数据进行一次最近邻查询。如果某个向量暂时缺失，应用可以使用先前的 arXiv 版本，或通过现有的基于任务和引用关系的回退机制补充结果。我们通过 Semantic Scholar API 获取引用数据，还构建了 s2-cli，这是一个用于查询其引用图的命令行接口。后者由 https://paperswithcode.co/chat 上的智能体使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "feec750493c35d6f",
      "translationZh": "我们学到的经验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "457743d356fa3826",
      "translationZh": "1. 将侧重吞吐量的工作与延迟敏感型工作分开",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b188eaa32e6002ea",
      "translationZh": "语料库嵌入和查询嵌入使用相同的模型，但它们是不同的基础设施问题。Jobs 针对吞吐量和有界成本进行优化；Inference Endpoints 针对可用性和请求延迟进行优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f618a7c15ed2fa4b",
      "translationZh": "2. 让存储成为计算与生产环境之间的明确契约",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43c5db6b0cc9fd6e",
      "translationZh": "存储桶为计算与生产环境之间提供了明确的交接点。带有校验和的产物在数据进入生产索引之前，建立了一道可供审查的边界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7045e6fc47e7ca2c",
      "translationZh": "3. 不只要固定模型名称",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e05047cdc5d4093",
      "translationZh": "版本、维度、提示词、归一化方式和输入格式化器都会影响检索。将它们一起存储，并在所有环节进行验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "67aa6c13fca5b190",
      "translationZh": "4. 为冷启动做好设计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9dfaadf65ccea55",
      "translationZh": "当流量不连续时，缩容至零很有价值，但前提是产品具备快速的回退方案。混合搜索自然地为我们提供了这种回退方案：词法搜索即使单独使用，也始终有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d84f2d51735ef090",
      "translationZh": "5. 更小的向量可以成为一项系统特性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afcdd1cf114679d5",
      "translationZh": "Matryoshka 嵌入让我们能够将质量、内存、索引大小和延迟作为一组权衡来评估。在我们的试点中，与 1024 维相比，256 维保留了 ANN 召回率，同时显著减少了存储占用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a46fe9fd8908cf4c",
      "translationZh": "6. 启用应该平淡无奇",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ab5143452b07d14",
      "translationZh": "新一代数据与当前一代数据并行导入，独立建立索引，检查覆盖范围是否完整且为最新状态，然后以原子方式激活。回滚只需变更配置，而不必紧急重新计算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
